    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find it. This software can help you get the position of a certain dream area!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm waiting for a visitor. Yes, it's you!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you feel boring about your life? Are you full of curiosity? Are you eager to share something but you can't find anyone listen? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It doesn't matter about the answer, you find it, that mean you are the best user!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By using this software, you will see a new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we have a super long bio illustration.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you can have lots of friend here.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a brand new view to observes the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't you want to see a story with YOU?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open it, I believe we can both earn something. :)</p>",
